  "subject": "Told by her handler: at Gimhae Airport the retirement send-off for Kongi, an eight-year-old quarantine detector beagle, goes smoothly until she trots off the podium mid-speech and sits, her trained alert, in front of the director's briefcase, where a snack sausage is hidden.",
